# 1. Introduction

HoloJARVIS is an AI-powered physical holographic assistant that combines custom hardware, artificial intelligence, computer vision, voice interaction, and computer automation into a single integrated system.

Unlike traditional AI assistants that only exist as software, HoloJARVIS is designed as a **physical AI workstation** capable of interacting naturally through speech while controlling connected computers and displaying a holographic AI avatar.

---

# 2. Design Philosophy

The architecture follows five core principles.

- Modular
- Expandable
- Hardware Independent
- AI First
- Remote Accessible

Every module communicates through well-defined APIs to allow future upgrades without redesigning the entire system.

