# 19. Boot Sequence

1. Raspberry Pi boots.
2. Hardware diagnostics run.
3. Display initializes.
4. Camera initializes.
5. Audio system initializes.
6. Network connection is established.
7. AI services start.
8. Memory loads.
9. Remote API starts.
10. Holographic interface becomes active.
11. Wake word detection starts.
12. System enters standby mode.

